  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Arial\"><img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/maps/entity-tester/logo.webp\" alt=\"Entity Tester Logo\"><br><br>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:32px\">一個用於測試生物紋理與模型的世界！</h2>\n<a style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:40px;color:#1ea1f1;display:block\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fewanhowell.com%252fmaps%252fentity-tester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在我的網站上查看此地圖！</a> <br><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uScROs4RF6I\" width=\"600\" height=\"336\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br>\n<p>這張地圖將所有生物集中展示在一個小區域內，方便您隨時測試模型與紋理！<br><br>提供三種模式供您選擇：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一般模式 - 顯示遊戲中的所有生物</li>\n<li>幼體模式 - 顯示擁有幼體形態的生物</li>\n<li>騎乘模式 - 顯示遊戲中的所有騎乘組合</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/956/935/2024-09-02_11.png\" alt=\"Entities\" width=\"600\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/956/941/2024-09-02_12.jpg\" alt=\"Variants\" width=\"600\"><br><br>\n<div>⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯</div>\n<br><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.ewanhowell.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\">\n<div style=\"line-height:6px\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#5662f6\">加入 Discord 伺服器！</p>\n</a>\n<div style=\"line-height:12px\">&nbsp;</div>\n<a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fresourcepacks.ewanhowell.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\">\n<div style=\"line-height:6px\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#5662f6\">加入資源包開發 Discord 伺服器！</p>\n</a>\n<div style=\"line-height:12px\">&nbsp;</div>\n<a style=\"text-decoration:no